<title>RUSSIA: Russian car ownership rises to 15.2 million Dec 1.</title>
<headline>Russian car ownership rises to 15.2 million Dec 1.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russians owned 15.2 million cars as of December 1, 1996, up from 8.7 million in 1990, the State Statistics Committee said on Monday.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
